{"body":{"text":["*Unratified: not yet read by the author (23/156). Knowledge is to be rewritten whole once the elevation is done (23/152); until then, the rest of it still speaks of what goes as current.*"]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS4000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["What a session knows is in the field; memory is off (2/6). A session is kept whole: the author's words as said, its answers by their essence, read against the transcript by blank readers until nothing is distorted or lost (13/129, 23/138). What matters in it is lifted into the elevation, below."]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS4001","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Knowledge is meant as the current snapshot under the rule, as the author leans, unsure (23/154). It is written whole, never patched (23/144), and checked under the rule, against what it rests on, and as a whole, until readers bring nothing back; then he reads it (23/138). Whenever it falls behind the sessions, a session reflects on it; writing it after every session is good practice, not a rule (23/154). How far the code has come is said in a line in each part (15/7)."]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS4002","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The author's tools in `author/` write the field through the engine: `session.ts`, `append.ts` and `rewrite.ts`. Their thread, path, cycle and measure features are no part of the work, and changing words inside a kept paragraph with `rewrite.ts` is patching. The tools are to go (settled 2026-11-11); whether now or once commits are written in the field is open (23/146, 23/148)."]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS4003","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["A question will be held as a statement whose status is open, once the statement type exists (10/8, 23/79). A session commits what it did before it ends, and none starts on another's uncommitted work (4/2)."]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS4004","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["*The author's leaning (23/50 to 23/138); the session's additions are marked as such.*"]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS4005","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The elevation lifts what was said so that all of it can be looked upon and only what matters seen, to steer by (23/50, 23/52). It stands between the sessions, the ground, and Knowledge, which says what holds and why (23/94)."]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS4006","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["A **statement** is one sentence under the rule, saying what it conveys; a second is allowed only for its reason, the session's addition (23/129). A task is named as the doing, and an objection is written as what is held instead (23/98, 23/119). It has no name or address, is reached by its id, and points at the utterances or sentences it rests on, shown by their numbers (23/115, 23/116)."]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS4007","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Its **status** is where it stands now: open, proposed (the session's, not taken up), leaning, settled or closed (23/129, 23/137, 23/138). Each points at the utterance that gave it, so whose it is stays plain. Closed points at what closed it and may reopen on new ground; the author leans to the word, though it says nothing of why (23/138). A statement's history is its versions (23/132)."]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS4008","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["**Work** is marked only on something to do: to do, or done with its commit. Once done, the statement is said again as what now holds (23/124, 23/132). What is planned is every statement still to do."]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS4009","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["A **topic** is a type of its own: a short, addressable name holding statements and topics, a statement free to stand in several (23/86, 23/111, 23/116). Its spans, between(session, from, to), are read from its statements' grounds and written by hand only beyond them (23/80, 23/110, 23/129)."]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS400A","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Work that belongs together is a brief in Knowledge, and its order is prose there, not typed data (23/100, 23/116). How a brief's flow holds statements is open, the session's question."]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS400B","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Threads, paths, cycles, condensations and measures go with the redraw; until then they stay in the field and are no part of the work (23/110, 23/111). Statistics may stay (23/52). Values are to be a brief of their own, not quotes lifted one by one (23/62)."]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS400C","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The elevation gives what, not why; the reasoning stays in the sessions and in Knowledge, as the session answered (23/93). An earlier form was tried over every session: 459 statements, 420 fitting, the model mended by the rest (23/85 to 23/89, 23/129)."]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS400D","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["The next session starts here (23/130). It writes the types, statement and topic, with their moulds; draws the twelfth, eighteenth and twenty-third sessions and has a blank reader read them back; then draws every session, gathers the work in briefs, lets the old structures go, and rewrites Knowledge whole (23/129, 23/131, 23/152). *The order the session's; the author's go-ahead, 23/138.*"]},"id":"1M89RZTFPCS400E","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}